title: Grid tour
# One train that uses all three ways LEGO's grids let gears meet
motor pf-l
axle A 0   0
axle B 2.5 0           # 16 + 24 = 20 mm = 2.5 studs: the half-stud grid
axle C 2.5 5           # 16 over 16 = 16 mm = 5 plates straight up
axle D 4   10          # 20 + 20 = 20 mm on the diagonal: 12 mm across, 16 mm up
gear A 16 at 0
gear B 24 at 0
gear B 16 at 1
gear C 16 at 1
gear C 20 at 2
gear D 20 at 2
output D
wheel D 81.6           # 81.6 x 15 tyre
